      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand the INT_RISING requirement. Is that the only way to wake the EC? On a rising signal? If so, then I think we need an inverter. Or are you saying this works and wake from hibernate is just like a reset so we start from RO and do all our initialization that way?",
