      "writtenOn": "2018-07-10T16:10:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, INT_RISING is not the requirement. It can wake on either rising or falling. Wake from hibernate is just like a reset so we start from RO and perform all initialization.",
      "parentUuid": "6b5b81ed_afb0521c",
      "revId": "66d217cbf409de9c8fce13bd0b04efd2959f4569",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
