      "writtenOn": "2018-07-10T16:31:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we are intentionally waking on rising edge?\n\nAnd why is MECH_PWR_BTN not marked with HIB_WAKE_LOW? Are we only waking on rising edge of that?",
      "parentUuid": "de6247ae_6dd15cdd",
      "revId": "66d217cbf409de9c8fce13bd0b04efd2959f4569",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
